test_v2_sample_tokens_runs_eplb_on_non_last_pp_rank on `SimpleNamespace has no
attribute 'ple_serving'`. Targeted re-run of
tests/v1/worker/gpu + test_mamba_utils + test_mamba_hybrid_model_state +
test_gpu_block_table + test_pp_utils: 65 passed.

Not verified without a GPU: that the Triton kernel compiles with the new
constexpr, and the on-GPU effect. Both need the planned V.5-shape boot.
